#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:124
msgid "Installation of ISC DHCP"
msgstr "Instalação do <quote>ISC DHCP</quote>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:138
msgid "This package does not support parallel build."
msgstr "Esse pacote não suporta construção paralela."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:151
msgid ""
"Be careful with the instructions below. The single and double quotes are "
"important because the defined variables are used verbatim in the code."
msgstr ""
"Tenha cuidado com as instruções abaixo. As aspas simples e duplas são "
"importantes porque as variáveis definidas são usadas literalmente no código."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:158
msgid ""
"Install <application>ISC DHCP</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale &quot;<application>ISC DHCP</application>&quot; executando os "
"seguintes comandos:"

#.    Running ( export CFLAGS=... ./configure ... ) in a subshell
#.    preserves CFLAGS if they are set in environment
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:166
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<userinput>( export CFLAGS=\"${CFLAGS:--g -O2} -Wall -fno-strict-aliasing                 \\\n"
"        -D_PATH_DHCLIENT_SCRIPT='\\\"/usr/sbin/dhclient-script\\\"'     \\\n"
"        -D_PATH_DHCPD_CONF='\\\"/etc/dhcp/dhcpd.conf\\\"'               \\\n"
"        -D_PATH_DHCLIENT_CONF='\\\"/etc/dhcp/dhclient.conf\\\"'\"        &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr                                           \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc/dhcp                                  \\\n"
"            --localstatedir=/var                                    \\\n"
"            --with-srv-lease-file=/var/lib/dhcpd/dhcpd.leases       \\\n"
"            --with-srv6-lease-file=/var/lib/dhcpd/dhcpd6.leases     \\\n"
"            --with-cli-lease-file=/var/lib/dhclient/dhclient.leases \\\n"
"            --with-cli6-lease-file=/var/lib/dhclient/dhclient6.leases\n"
") &amp;&amp;\n"
"make -j1</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>( export CFLAGS=\"${CFLAGS:--g -O2} -Wall -fno-strict-"
"aliasing                \\\n"
"        -D_PATH_DHCLIENT_SCRIPT='\\\"/usr/sbin/dhclient-script\\\"'     \\\n"
"        -D_PATH_DHCPD_CONF='\\\"/etc/dhcp/dhcpd.conf\\\"'               \\\n"
"        -D_PATH_DHCLIENT_CONF='\\\"/etc/dhcp/dhclient.conf\\\"'\"        "
"&amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr                                           \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc/dhcp                                  \\\n"
"            --localstatedir=/var                                    \\\n"
"            --with-srv-lease-file=/var/lib/dhcpd/dhcpd.leases       \\\n"
"            --with-srv6-lease-file=/var/lib/dhcpd/dhcpd6.leases     \\\n"
"            --with-cli-lease-file=/var/lib/dhclient/dhclient.leases \\\n"
"            --with-cli6-lease-file=/var/lib/dhclient/dhclient6.leases\n"
") &amp;&amp;\n"
"make -j1</userinput>"

#.  Note: make check builds a library, but otherwise does nothing. 
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:183
msgid "This package does not come with a test suite."
msgstr "Esse pacote não vem com uma suíte de teste."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:187
msgid ""
"If you only want to install the <application>ISC DHCP</application> client, "
"issue the following commands as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</"
"systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Se você deseja instalar somente o cliente &quot;<application>ISC "
"DHCP</application>&quot;, [então] emita os seguintes comandos como o(a) "
"usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:192
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<userinput>make -C client install             &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m755 client/scripts/linux /usr/sbin/dhclient-script</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>make -C client install            &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m755 client/scripts/linux /usr/sbin/dhclient-script</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:196
msgid ""
"Skip to <xref linkend=\"dhclient-config\"/> in order to configure the client"
msgstr ""
"Pule para &quot;<xref linkend=\"dhclient-config\"/>&quot; para a finalidade "
"de configurar o cliente"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:201
msgid ""
"If you only want to install the <application>ISC DHCP</application> server, "
"issue the following command as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</"
"systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Se você deseja instalar somente o servidor &quot;<application>ISC "
"DHCP</application>&quot;, [então] emita o seguinte comando como o(a) "
"usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:206
#, no-wrap
msgid "<userinput>make -C server install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make -C server install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:209
msgid ""
"Skip to <xref linkend=\"dhcpd-config\"/> in order to configure the server."
msgstr ""
"Pule para &quot;<xref linkend=\"dhcpd-config\"/>&quot; para a finalidade de "
"configurar o servidor."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:213
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can install whole package which includes the client, "
"server, relay, static libraries and development headers by running the "
"following commands as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> "
"user:"
msgstr ""
"Alternativamente, você consegue instalar o pacote inteiro, que inclui o "
"cliente, servidor, retransmissão, bibliotecas estáticas e cabeçalhos de "
"desenvolvimento executando os seguintes comandos como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;"
"<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:219
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<userinput>make install &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m755 client/scripts/linux /usr/sbin/dhclient-script</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>make install &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m755 client/scripts/linux /usr/sbin/dhclient-script</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:225
msgid "Configuring ISC DHCP"
msgstr "Configurando o <quote>ISC DHCP</quote>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:228
msgid "Config Files"
msgstr "Arquivos de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:231
msgid ""
"<filename>/etc/dhcp/dhclient.conf</filename> and <filename>/etc/dhcp/dhcpd."
"conf</filename>"
msgstr ""
"<filename>/etc/dhcp/dhclient.conf</filename> e <filename>/etc/dhcp/dhcpd."
"conf</filename>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:236
msgid "/etc/dhcp/dhclient.conf"
msgstr "/etc/dhcp/dhclient.conf"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:240
msgid "/etc/dhcp/dhcpd.conf"
msgstr "/etc/dhcp/dhcpd.conf"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:246
msgid "Client Configuration"
msgstr "Configuração do Cliente"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:249
msgid ""
"Create a basic <filename>/etc/dhcp/dhclient.conf</filename> by running the "
"following command as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> "
"user:"
msgstr ""
"Crie um &quot;<filename>/etc/dhcp/dhclient.conf</filename>&quot; básico "
"executando o seguinte comando como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem class="
"\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:254
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -vdm755 /etc/dhcp &amp;&amp;\n"
"cat &gt; /etc/dhcp/dhclient.conf &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Begin /etc/dhcp/dhclient.conf\n"
"#\n"
"# Basic dhclient.conf(5)\n"
"\n"
"#prepend domain-name-servers 127.0.0.1;\n"
"request subnet-mask, broadcast-address, time-offset, routers,\n"
"        domain-name, domain-name-servers, domain-search, host-name,\n"
"        netbios-name-servers, netbios-scope, interface-mtu,\n"
"        ntp-servers;\n"
"require subnet-mask, domain-name-servers;\n"
"#timeout 60;\n"
"#retry 60;\n"
"#reboot 10;\n"
"#select-timeout 5;\n"
"#initial-interval 2;\n"
"\n"
"# End /etc/dhcp/dhclient.conf</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install -vdm755 /etc/dhcp &amp;&amp;\n"
"cat &gt; /etc/dhcp/dhclient.conf &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Inicia /etc/dhcp/dhclient.conf\n"
"#\n"
"# Um dhclient.conf(5) básico\n"
"\n"
"#prepend domain-name-servers 127.0.0.1;\n"
"request subnet-mask, broadcast-address, time-offset, routers,\n"
"        domain-name, domain-name-servers, domain-search, host-name,\n"
"        netbios-name-servers, netbios-scope, interface-mtu,\n"
"        ntp-servers;\n"
"require subnet-mask, domain-name-servers;\n"
"#timeout 60;\n"
"#retry 60;\n"
"#reboot 10;\n"
"#select-timeout 5;\n"
"#initial-interval 2;\n"
"\n"
"# Termina /etc/dhcp/dhclient.conf</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:276
msgid "See <command>man 5 dhclient.conf</command> for additional options."
msgstr ""
"Veja-se &quot;<command>man 5 dhclient.conf</command>&quot; para opções "
"adicionais."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:280
msgid ""
"Now create the <filename class=\"directory\">/var/lib/dhclient</filename> "
"directory which will contain DHCP Client leases by running the following "
"command as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora crie o diretório &quot;<filename class=\"directory\">/var/lib/"
"dhclient</filename>&quot; que conterá concessões do cliente &quot;DHCP&quot; "
"executando o seguinte comando como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem class="
"\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:285
#, no-wrap
msgid "<userinput>install -v -dm 755 /var/lib/dhclient</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>install -v -dm 755 /var/lib/dhclient</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:288
msgid ""
"If you want to configure network interfaces at boot using <command>dhclient</"
"command>, you need to install the <filename>dhclient@.service</filename> "
"unit included in the <xref linkend=\"systemd-units\"/> package by running "
"the following command as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</"
"systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Se você deseja configurar interfaces de rede de intercomunicação na "
"inicialização usando o &quot;<command>dhclient</command>&quot;, [então] você "
"precisa instalar a unidade &quot;<filename>dhclient@.service</filename>&quot;"
" incluída no pacote &quot;<xref linkend=\"systemd-units\"/>&quot; executando "
"o seguinte comando como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem class=\"username\""
">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:296
msgid "dhclient@.service"
msgstr "dhclient@.service"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:299
#, no-wrap
msgid "<userinput>make install-dhclient</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install-dhclient</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><note><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:303
msgid ""
"Make sure that you disable the <command>systemd-networkd</command> service "
"or configure it not to manage the interfaces you want to manage with "
"<command>dhclient</command>."
msgstr ""
"Certifique-se de desabilitar o serviço &quot;<command>systemd-"
"networkd</command>&quot; ou configurá-lo para não gerenciar as interfaces "
"que você quer gerenciar com o &quot;<command>dhclient</command>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:310
msgid ""
"At this point you can test if <command>dhclient</command> is behaving as "
"expected by running the following command as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Neste ponto você consegue testar se o &quot;<command>dhclient</command>&quot;"
" está se comportando conforme esperado executando o seguinte comando como "
"o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:317
#, no-wrap
msgid "<userinput>dhclient <replaceable>&lt;eth0&gt;</replaceable></userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>dhclient <replaceable>&lt;eth0&gt;</replaceable></userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:321
#, no-wrap
msgid "<userinput>systemctl start dhclient@<replaceable>eth0</replaceable></userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>systemctl start dhclient@<replaceable>eth0</replaceable></userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:324
msgid ""
"Replace <replaceable>&lt;eth0&gt;</replaceable> with your desired interface. "
"If you want more verbose output, add the <command>-v</command> parameter to "
"the command above."
msgstr ""
"Substitua &quot;<replaceable>&lt;eth0&gt;</replaceable>&quot; pela tua "
"interface desejada. Se você quiser uma saída gerada mais detalhada, [então] "
"adicione o parâmetro &quot;<command>-v</command>&quot; ao comando acima."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:330
msgid ""
"If you want to configure network interfaces at boot using <command>dhclient</"
"command>, you need to install the <filename>/lib/services/dhclient</"
"filename> script included in <xref linkend=\"bootscripts\"/> package:"
msgstr ""
"Se você deseja configurar interfaces de rede de intercomunicação na "
"inicialização usando o &quot;<command>dhclient</command>&quot;, [então] você "
"precisa instalar o conjunto sequencial de comandos &quot;<filename>/lib/"
"services/dhclient</filename>&quot; incluído no pacote &quot;<xref linkend="
"\"bootscripts\"/>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:336
#, no-wrap
msgid "<userinput>make install-service-dhclient</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install-service-dhclient</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:339
msgid "dhclient (service script)"
msgstr "dhclient (conjunto sequencial de comandos de serviço)"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:343
msgid ""
"Next, create the <filename>/etc/sysconfig/ifconfig.eth0</filename> "
"configuration file with the following commands as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Em seguida, crie o arquivo de configuração &quot;<filename>/etc/sysconfig/"
"ifconfig.eth0</filename>&quot; com os seguintes comandos como o(a) usuário(a)"
" &quot;<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:348
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/sysconfig/ifconfig.eth0 &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>ONBOOT=\"yes\"\n"
"IFACE=\"eth0\"\n"
"SERVICE=\"dhclient\"\n"
"DHCP_START=\"\"\n"
"DHCP_STOP=\"\"\n"
"\n"
"# Set PRINTIP=\"yes\" to have the script print\n"
"# the DHCP assigned IP address\n"
"PRINTIP=\"no\"\n"
"\n"
"# Set PRINTALL=\"yes\" to print the DHCP assigned values for\n"
"# IP, SM, DG, and 1st NS. This requires PRINTIP=\"yes\".\n"
"PRINTALL=\"no\"</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/sysconfig/ifconfig.eth0 &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>ONBOOT=\"yes\"\n"
"IFACE=\"eth0\"\n"
"SERVICE=\"dhclient\"\n"
"DHCP_START=\"\"\n"
"DHCP_STOP=\"\"\n"
"\n"
"# Configure PRINTIP=\"yes\" para que o conjunto sequencial de comandos "
"imprima\n"
"# o endereço \"IP\" atribuído pelo \"DHCP\"\n"
"PRINTIP=\"no\"\n"
"\n"
"# Configure PRINTALL=\"yes\" para imprimir os valores atribuídos pelo \"DHCP"
"\" para\n"
"# \"IP\", \"SM\", \"DG\" e 1º \"NS\". Isso exige PRINTIP=\"yes\".\n"
"PRINTALL=\"no\"</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:365
msgid "/etc/sysconfig/ifconfig.eth0"
msgstr "/etc/sysconfig/ifconfig.eth0"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:369
msgid "Adjust the file to suit your needs."
msgstr "Ajuste o arquivo para atender às tuas necessidades."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:373
msgid ""
"For more information on the appropriate <envar>DHCP_START</envar> and "
"<envar>DHCP_STOP</envar> values see <command>man 8 dhclient</command>."
msgstr ""
"Para mais informações relativas aos valores apropriados "
"&quot;<envar>DHCP_START</envar>&quot; e &quot;<envar>DHCP_STOP</envar>&quot;"
", veja-se &quot;<command>man 8 dhclient</command>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:379
msgid ""
"To start <command>dhclient</command> on a specific interface at boot, enable "
"the previously installed systemd unit by running the following command as "
"the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Para iniciar o &quot;<command>dhclient</command>&quot; em uma interface "
"específica na inicialização, habilite a unidade &quot;systemd&quot; "
"instalada anteriormente executando o seguinte comando como o(a) usuário(a) "
"&quot;<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:385
#, no-wrap
msgid "<userinput>systemctl enable dhclient@<replaceable>eth0</replaceable></userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>systemctl enable dhclient@<replaceable>eth0</replaceable></userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:388
msgid "Replace <replaceable>eth0</replaceable> with the actual interface name."
msgstr ""
"Substitua &quot;<replaceable>eth0</replaceable>&quot; pelo nome real da "
"interface."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:394
msgid "Server Configuration"
msgstr "Configuração do Servidor"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:397
msgid ""
"Note that you only need the DHCP server if you want to issue LAN addresses "
"over your network. The DHCP client doesn't need the server in order to "
"function properly."
msgstr ""
"Observe que você só precisa do servidor &quot;DHCP&quot; se quiser emitir "
"endereços &quot;LAN&quot; pela sua rede de intercomunicação. O cliente "
"&quot;DHCP&quot; não precisa do servidor para a finalidade de funcionar "
"corretamente."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:403
msgid ""
"Start with creating <filename>/etc/dhcp/dhcpd.conf</filename> by running the "
"following command as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> "
"user:"
msgstr ""
"Comece criando &quot;<filename>/etc/dhcp/dhcpd.conf</filename>&quot; "
"executando o seguinte comando como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem class="
"\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:408
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/dhcp/dhcpd.conf &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Begin /etc/dhcp/dhcpd.conf\n"
"#\n"
"# Example dhcpd.conf(5)\n"
"\n"
"# Use this to enable / disable dynamic dns updates globally.\n"
"ddns-update-style none;\n"
"\n"
"# option definitions common to all supported networks...\n"
"option domain-name \"example.org\";\n"
"option domain-name-servers ns1.example.org, ns2.example.org;\n"
"\n"
"default-lease-time 600;\n"
"max-lease-time 7200;\n"
"\n"
"# This is a very basic subnet declaration.\n"
"subnet 10.254.239.0 netmask 255.255.255.224 {\n"
"  range 10.254.239.10 10.254.239.20;\n"
"  option routers rtr-239-0-1.example.org, rtr-239-0-2.example.org;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"# End /etc/dhcp/dhcpd.conf</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/dhcp/dhcpd.conf &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Inicia /etc/dhcp/dhcpd.conf\n"
"#\n"
"# Um dhcpd.conf(5) de exemplo\n"
"\n"
"# Use isto para habilitar/desabilitar globalmente atualizações dinâmicas de "
"DNS.\n"
"ddns-update-style none;\n"
"\n"
"# Definições de opções comuns a todas as redes de intercomunicação "
"suportadas...\n"
"option domain-name \"exemplo.org\";\n"
"option domain-name-servers ns1.exemplo.org, ns2.exemplo.org;\n"
"\n"
"default-lease-time 600;\n"
"max-lease-time 7200;\n"
"\n"
"# Esta é uma declaração de sub-rede muito básica.\n"
"subnet 10.254.239.0 netmask 255.255.255.224 {\n"
"  range 10.254.239.10 10.254.239.20;\n"
"  option routers rtr-239-0-1.exemplo.org, rtr-239-0-2.exemplo.org;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"# Termina /etc/dhcp/dhcpd.conf</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:433
msgid ""
"Adjust the file to suit your needs. See <command>man 5 dhcpd.conf</command> "
"for additional options."
msgstr ""
"Ajuste o arquivo para atender às suas necessidades. Veja-se &quot;"
"<command>man 5 dhcpd.conf</command>&quot; para opções adicionais."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:439
msgid ""
"Now create the <filename>/var/lib/dhcpd/dhcpd.leases</filename> directory "
"which will contain DHCP Server leases by running the following commands as "
"the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora crie o diretório &quot;<filename>/var/lib/dhcpd/dhcpd."
"leases</filename>&quot; que conterá concessões do servidor &quot;DHCP&quot; "
"executando os seguintes comandos como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:444
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -v -dm 755 /var/lib/dhcpd &amp;&amp;\n"
"touch /var/lib/dhcpd/dhcpd.leases</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install -v -dm 755 /var/lib/dhcpd &amp;&amp;\n"
"touch /var/lib/dhcpd/dhcpd.leases</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:448
msgid ""
"If you want to start the DHCP Server at boot, install the <phrase "
"revision=\"sysv\"><filename>/etc/rc.d/init.d/dhcpd</filename> init script</"
"phrase> <phrase revision=\"systemd\"><filename>dhcpd.service</filename> "
"unit</phrase> included in the <xref linkend=\"bootscripts\" "
"revision=\"sysv\"/> <xref linkend=\"systemd-units\" revision=\"systemd\"/> "
"package:"
msgstr ""
"Se você deseja iniciar o servidor &quot;DHCP&quot; na inicialização, [então] "
"instale <phrase revision=\"sysv\">o conjunto sequencial de comandos de "
"iniciação &quot;<filename>/etc/rc.d/init.d/dhcpd</filename>&quot; incluído</"
"phrase><phrase revision=\"systemd\">a unidade &quot;<filename>dhcpd."
"service</filename>&quot; incluída</phrase> no pacote &quot;<xref linkend="
"\"bootscripts\" revision=\"sysv\"/>&quot; &quot;<xref linkend=\"systemd-"
"units\" revision=\"systemd\"/>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:458
#, no-wrap
msgid "<userinput>make install-dhcpd</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install-dhcpd</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:461
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:541
msgid "dhcpd"
msgstr "dhcpd"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcp.xml:465
msgid ""
"You will need to edit the <phrase revision=\"sysv\"><filename>/etc/sysconfig/"
"dhcpd</filename></phrase> <phrase revision=\"systemd\"><filename>/etc/"
"default/dhcpd</filename></phrase> in order to set the interface on which "
"<command>dhcpd</command> will serve the DHCP requests."
msgstr ""
"Você precisará editar o <phrase revision=\"sysv\">&quot;<filename>/etc/"
"sysconfig/dhcpd</filename>&quot;</phrase> <phrase revision=\"systemd\""
">&quot;<filename>/etc/default/dhcpd</filename>&quot;</phrase> para a "
"finalidade de configurar a interface na qual o "
"&quot;<command>dhcpd</command>&quot; atenderá as solicitações "
"&quot;DHCP&quot;."

